Install checked graph artifacts on trusted Linux hosts

Usage: leptoskit infra release <COMMAND>

Commands:
  plan      Save a release plan after checking independent artifact and host pins
  apply     Prepare candidates, recheck inputs, then activate each host
  status    Read journals and current pointers without claiming runtime readiness
  rollback  Reactivate an installed release, rechecking its original inputs
  help      Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help     Print help
  -V, --version  Print version
